[Sentry Server] Started on http://localhost:31337
[Sentry Server] Endpoints:
  POST   /api/:projectId/envelope/  - Receive envelopes
  POST   /api/:projectId/store/     - Legacy store endpoint
  GET    /events                    - List all stored events
  GET    /events/:eventId           - Fetch event by ID
  POST   /events/clear              - Clear all events
  GET    /health                    - Health check
